OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSPs walk out of parliament
OL,4,Ain protest against independence debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform MSPs have walked out of the
OL,7,FHolyrood chamber in protest against a
OL,8,Fdebate about Scottish independence.
OL,10,FThe party's Scottish leader Malcolm
OL,11,FOfford, who had tried to have the
OL,12,Fdebate cancelled because it related to
OL,13,Fnon-devolved matters, described it as
OL,14,Fan insult and a waste of time.
OL,16,FHe then led his MSPs out of the
OL,17,Fchamber, to jeers from the rest of the
OL,18,Fparliament.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
