OL,3,GNEWSAReform MSPs walk out of parliament
OL,4,Ain protest against independence debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt came after First Minister John
OL,7,FSwinney tabled a non-binding motion
OL,8,Fasserting Scotland's right to decide
OL,9,Fits constitutional future - which
OL,10,Fpassed with support from Labour and the
OL,11,FGreens.
